Booking a ride

The `Rider app` asks `Dispatch` for a car, with the label `request`. `Dispatch`
reads positions from `Locations`, with the label `nearest cars`, and offers the
ride to the `Driver app`, with the label `offer`. The `Driver app` answers
`Dispatch`, with the label `accept`. Then `Dispatch` tells the `Rider app`,
with the label `matched`.
---
Rider app -> Dispatch: request
Dispatch -> Locations: nearest cars
Dispatch -> Driver app: offer
Driver app -> Dispatch: accept
Dispatch -> Rider app: matched
